msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deinstallieren"

#: src/stickler_gtk/ui/window.py:714
msgid "Stickler can be uninstalled once the current work is done"
msgstr ""
"Stickler lässt sich deinstallieren, sobald die laufende Arbeit fertig ist"

