msgid "Remove the Flatpak"
msgstr "Das Flatpak entfernen"

#: src/stickler_gtk/ui/window.py:774
msgid ""
"No Software app opens Stickler’s page here. To remove Stickler, run in a "
"terminal (without --delete-data its models, settings and recent songs stay):"
